msgid "Bayes Factor Design"
msgstr "貝葉斯因子設計"

msgid "Bayes Factor Decision Probabilities"
msgstr "貝葉斯因子決策機率"

msgid "Design Specification"
msgstr "設計規格"

msgid ""
"Target conclusive evidence probability is not reached within the selected "
"sample-size range."
msgstr "在所選樣本量範圍內未達到目標確定性證據機率。"

msgid "Unable to compute Bayes factor design: %1$s"
msgstr "無法計算貝葉斯因子設計：%1$s"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Due to rounding of the sample size, Pr(Conclusive Evidence) can deviate from "
"the target probability."
msgstr "由於樣本數進位的緣故，實際的檢定力可能會偏離目標檢定力。"

msgid ""
"For independent samples, N₁ is the sample size in group 1 and N₂ is rounded "
"up from the requested N₂/N₁ sample-size ratio."
msgstr "對於獨立樣本，N₁ 為第 1 組的樣本量，N₂ 由所請求的 N₂/N₁ 樣本量比率向上取整得出。"

msgid "Computed"
msgstr "已計算"

msgid "User Defined"
msgstr "使用者自訂"

msgid "Design Prior"
msgstr "設計先驗"

msgid "Decision Rule"
msgstr "決策規則"

msgid "Target Probability"
msgstr "目標機率"

msgid "Achieved Probability"
msgstr "達成機率"

msgid "Bayes Factor Decision"
msgstr "貝葉斯因子決策"

msgid "Evidence for H₀"
msgstr "支援 H₀ 的證據"

msgid "Evidence for H₁"
msgstr "支援 H₁ 的證據"

msgid "Unable to compute Bayes factor decision probabilities: %1$s"
msgstr "無法計算貝葉斯因子決策機率：%1$s"

msgid ""
"To satisfy both design priors in a single fixed design, use N₁ = %1$s and N₂ "
"= %2$s (total N = %3$s)."
msgstr "要在單一固定設計中同時滿足兩個設計先驗，請使用 N₁ = %1$s 和 N₂ = %2$s（總 N = %3$s）。"

msgid "To satisfy both design priors in a single fixed design, use N = %1$s."
msgstr "要在單一固定設計中同時滿足兩個設計先驗，請使用 N = %1$s。"

msgid ""
"Probabilities are evaluated at the fixed-design sample size required for the "
"corresponding design prior under H₁ or H₀."
msgstr "機率在相應設計先驗（H₁ 或 H₀）所需的固定設計樣本量處計算。"

msgid ""
"Probabilities are evaluated at the fixed-design sample size required for "
"each design prior: under H₁, N₁ = %1$s and N₂ = %2$s; under H₀, N₁ = %3$s "
"and N₂ = %4$s."
msgstr "機率在每種設計先驗所需的固定設計樣本量處計算：H₁ 下 N₁ = %1$s 且 N₂ = %2$s；H₀ 下 N₁ = %3$s 且 N₂ = %4$s。"

msgid ""
"Probabilities are evaluated at the fixed-design sample size required for "
"each design prior: under H₁, N = %1$s; under H₀, N = %2$s."
msgstr "機率在每種設計先驗所需的固定設計樣本量處計算：H₁ 下 N = %1$s；H₀ 下 N = %2$s。"

msgid ""
"Probabilities are evaluated at the selected fixed-design sample size. Rows "
"use the corresponding design prior under H₁ or H₀."
msgstr "機率在所選固定設計樣本量處計算。各行使用 H₁ 或 H₀ 下相應的設計先驗。"

msgid ""
"Probabilities are evaluated at the selected fixed-design sample sizes. Rows "
"use the corresponding design prior under H₁ or H₀."
msgstr "機率在所選固定設計樣本量處計算。各行使用 H₁ 或 H₀ 下相應的設計先驗。"

msgid ""
"Probabilities are evaluated at the selected fixed-design sample sizes: N₁ = "
"%1$s and N₂ = %2$s (total N = %3$s). Rows use the corresponding design prior "
"under H₁ or H₀."
msgstr "機率在所選固定設計樣本量處計算：N₁ = %1$s 且 N₂ = %2$s（總 N = %3$s）。各行使用 H₁ 或 H₀ 下相應的設計先驗。"

msgid ""
"Probabilities are evaluated at the selected fixed-design sample size: N = "
"%1$s. Rows use the corresponding design prior under H₁ or H₀."
msgstr "機率在所選固定設計樣本量處計算：N = %1$s。各行使用 H₁ 或 H₀ 下相應的設計先驗。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Sample size is not available."
msgstr "至少 %s 的樣本數"

msgid "%1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s：%2$s"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Error:"
msgstr "錯誤訊息："

msgid ""
"This table reports the smallest fixed-design sample size that reaches the "
"target probability of conclusive evidence for each design prior."
msgstr "此表報告每種設計先驗達到目標確定性證據機率所需的最小固定設計樣本量。"

msgid ""
"This table evaluates the selected fixed sample size. Achieved probabilities "
"are the chances that the planned study produces conclusive evidence in the "
"requested direction when data are generated from the corresponding design "
"prior."
msgstr "此表對所選固定樣本量進行評估。達成機率是指在從相應設計先驗生成資料時，計劃研究在所請求方向上產生確定性證據的可能性。"

msgid ""
"Rows condition on the design prior used to generate hypothetical data. "
"Diagonal cells are conclusive evidence for the true hypothesis, off-diagonal "
"cells are misleading evidence, and the middle column is the chance of "
"remaining inconclusive."
msgstr "各行以用於生成假設資料的設計先驗為條件。對角單元格是對真實假設的確定性證據，非對角單元格是誤導性證據，中間列為保持無定論的機會。"

msgid ""
"The analysis prior is used to compute the Bayes factor from the data. The "
"design prior describes the effect sizes assumed during planning; it can "
"differ from the analysis prior."
msgstr "分析先驗用於從資料計算貝葉斯因子。設計先驗描述規劃期間假定的效應量；它可與分析先驗不同。"

msgid ""
"Summary statistics are the data summaries used to compute the observed Bayes "
"factor."
msgstr "彙總統計量是用於計算觀測貝葉斯因子的資料彙總。"

msgid ""
"The observed-data analysis applies the planned sequential decision rule to "
"the current data. It is an interim or final decision for the observed study, "
"not an operating characteristic of the design."
msgstr "觀測資料分析將計劃的序貫決策規則應用於當前資料。它是觀測研究的中期或最終決策，而非設計的操作特徵。"

msgid ""
"The observed-data analysis applies the planned fixed-design Bayes factor "
"rule to the current data. It is the decision for this observed study, not an "
"operating characteristic of the design."
msgstr "觀測資料分析將計劃的固定設計貝葉斯因子規則應用於當前資料。它是該觀測研究的決策，而非設計的操作特徵。"

msgid "Observed Data Analysis"
msgstr "觀測資料分析"

msgid "Analysis Result"
msgstr "分析結果"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Summary Statistics"
msgstr "特徵"

msgid "Unable to summarize observed data: %1$s"
msgstr "無法彙總觀測資料：%1$s"

msgid "Unable to compute observed Bayes factor: %1$s"
msgstr "無法計算觀測貝葉斯因子：%1$s"

msgid ""
"For t-tests, the estimate is the standardized mean difference on the "
"analysis scale."
msgstr "對於 t 檢驗，估計值是分析尺度上的標準化均數差。"

msgid ""
"Sequential decisions use the configured BF thresholds for the current "
"observed data."
msgstr "序貫決策對當前觀測資料使用已配置的 BF 閾值。"

